FerrionOS change to the Redox kernel (MIT license, kept), made against upstream commit e7f1d4231d0f4b55fbef229d9cd9459302c101f4 with ferrion-quiet-boot.patch, ferrion-boot-name.patch, ferrion-lockdown.patch and ferrion-scheme-short-read.patch applied:
- an event-queue call removes the subscriptions it wrote for the call however its read ends, so a non-blocking poll that finds nothing no longer leaves them registered.

